We show the overall performance of Logsy compared to the baselines in Figure 36.
Generally, Logsy achieves the best scores, with an averaged F1 score in all splits of 0.448 on the Blue Gene/L dataset, 0.99 on the Thunderbird dataset, and 0.77 on the Spirit data.
DeepLog and PCA have lower F1 scores in all performed experiments.
The baselines have a very high recall, but low precision.
This implies that they can find the anomalies.
